{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08867","headline":"寄远十一首 十 · 李白","name":"寄远十一首 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鲁缟如玉霜，笔题月氏书。\n寄书白鹦鹉，西海慰离居。\n行数虽不多，字字有委曲。\n天末如见之，开缄泪相续。\n泪尽恨转深，千里同此心。\n相思千万里，一书值千金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08867.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08867","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}